      "id": "teach_7_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Equal time means distance ratio = speed ratio:\n\nDownstream : upstream = 26:14 = 13:7.\nLet speeds be 13x and 7x. Their midpoint is 10, so 10x=10 and x=1.\nCurrent = (13−7)/2 = 3 km/hr.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
